1. Use and sharing
   You may download, install and use the GlucoDisplay app free of charge for
   personal, non-commercial purposes, and share the unmodified APK as published
   on the official GlucoDisplay releases page.

2. Restrictions
   You may not sell the app, charge for it, modify it, decompile it to make
   derived versions, distribute modified versions, or bundle it with other
   software, without written permission from the authors.

3. Not a medical device
   GlucoDisplay is not a medical device and has not been reviewed or approved
   by any regulator. It only displays readings obtained from the LibreLinkUp
   service. It must not be used for diagnosis, for treatment or dosing
   decisions, or in place of the alarms of the official sensor apps. Readings
   can be delayed, missing or wrong. Always confirm with your sensor or a
   blood glucose meter before acting.

4. Third-party service
   GlucoDisplay is an independent project. It is not made by, endorsed by or
   affiliated with Abbott. FreeStyle Libre, LibreLink, LibreLinkUp and
   LibreView are trademarks of Abbott. The app uses the same service as the
   LibreLinkUp app with the account you enter; Abbott's terms for that service
   do not allow automated access by third-party apps, so access may stop
   working or be blocked at any time. You are responsible for the use of your
   account.

5. No warranty, no liability
   The app is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
   implied, including fitness for a particular purpose. To the maximum extent
   permitted by law, the authors are not liable for any damage, injury or loss
   arising from its use or from the inability to use it. You use it at your
   own risk.

6. Your data
   Your LibreLinkUp email and password are stored only on your phone and are
   sent only to the LibreLinkUp service. Readings and settings stay on your
   phone. The app has no ads, analytics or tracking. Release builds check the
   GitHub releases page once a day for a new version; that request carries no
   personal data.

